================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
================================================================================

The MIT grant above covers the original work in this repository: the Unreal
Engine integration layer, the collision backends, the console and bind systems,
the audio layer, the test suite, the build tooling and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover the following, which are not the copyright holder's
to license:

  Movement algorithms
    The contents of Source/SourceMovement/Private/Core and the corresponding
    headers are a port of Valve's CGameMovement and CCSGameMovement. The
    algorithms, constants and behaviour are Valve's work. Every ported function
    carries a file:line reference to its original so the provenance is explicit
    rather than hidden. This repository is a study of that code; it is not an
    original movement design and is not claimed as one.

  Unreal Engine template content
    Assets shipped with Unreal Engine templates remain under the Unreal Engine
    EULA and are excluded from version control (see .gitignore).

  Audio
    The footstep, landing and wind sounds used during development are Valve
    assets. They are NOT part of this repository and are excluded from version
    control. Supply your own; see the Audio section of the README.

If you intend to use this in a commercial product, assess the first item for
yourself. Reproducing another engine's movement code carries obligations and
risks that an MIT header on the surrounding glue does not remove.
